  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Illustrated poster headed 'IMAGINE HELPING ALL THESE BUTTS', showing many cartoon figures seen from behind in jeans, skirts and shorts standing on a map of North America, with flags reading 'Check me out!', 'My bottom is at the top of my list!' and 'My butt is getting the attention it deserves!'. The logo 'the ANCHOR study.org' appears at the bottom.",
